j_kii_tgq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m003-0087","start":87,"end":89,"surface":"熊繹","kind":"person","person_id":"dmj_kii_tgq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m003-0090","start":90,"end":94,"surface":"魯公伯禽","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_ADA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m003-0095","start":95,"end":100,"surface":"衞康叔子牟","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"衞康叔子牟的稱呼與斷句需對照衛篇和版本；不由常見康叔名封自行改字或決定父子。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m003-0101","start":101,"end":104,"surface":"晉侯燮","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m003-0105","start":105,"end":111,"surface":"齊太公子呂伋","kind":"person","person_id":"1g3_02y_oor_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m003-0113","start":113,"end":115,"surface":"成王","kind":"person","person_id":"qna_m75_pj8","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p013","text":"武王十七年，晉之曲沃莊伯弒主國晉孝侯。十九年，鄭伯弟段作亂。二十一年，鄭侵天子之田。二十三年，衞弒其君桓公。二十九年，魯弒其君隱公。三十一年，宋太宰華督弒其君殤公。三十五年，楚伐隨。隨曰：「我無罪。」楚曰：「我蠻夷也。今諸侯皆爲叛相侵，或相殺。我有敝甲，欲以觀中國之政，請王室尊吾號。」隨人爲之周，請尊楚，王室不聽，還報楚。三十七年，楚熊通怒曰：「吾先鬻熊，文王之師也，蚤終。成王舉我先公，乃以子男田令居楚，蠻夷皆率服，而王不加位，我自尊耳。」乃自立爲武王，與隨人盟而去。於是始開濮地而有之。五十一年，周召隨侯，數以立楚爲王。楚怒，以隨背己，伐隨。武王卒師中而兵罷。子文王熊貲立，始都郢。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m013-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"1l4_2pq_e7w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m013-0008","start":8,"end":12,"surface":"曲沃莊伯","kind":"person","person_id":"di1_tea_bkj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m013-0015","start":15,"end":18,"surface":"晉孝侯","kind":"person","person_id":"eqp_oer_tei","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m013-0023","start":23,"end