_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p016","text":"成王惲元年，初卽位，布德施惠，結舊好於諸侯。使人獻天子，天子賜胙，曰：「鎭爾南方夷越之亂，無侵中國。」於是楚地千里。十六年，齊桓公以兵侵楚，至陘山。楚成王使將軍屈完以兵御之，與桓公盟。桓公數以周之賦不入王室，楚許之，乃去。十八年，成王以兵北伐許，許君肉袒謝，乃釋之。二十二年，伐黃。二十六年，滅英。三十三年，宋襄公欲爲盟會，召楚。楚王怒曰：「召我，我將好往襲辱之。」遂行，至盂，遂執辱宋公，已而歸之。三十四年，鄭文公南朝楚。楚成王北伐宋，敗之泓，射傷宋襄公，襄公遂病創死。三十五年，晉公子重耳過楚，成王以諸侯客禮饗，而厚送之於秦。三十九年，魯僖公來請兵以伐齊，楚使申侯將兵伐齊，取穀，置齊桓公子雍焉。齊桓公七子皆奔楚，楚盡以爲上大夫。滅夔，夔不祀祝融、鬻熊故也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m016-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"成王惲","kind":"person","person_id":"osu_yvw_bwr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m016-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"天子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"獻天子、天子賜胙的周王稱尚待核明任時身份，不按推算紀年補名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m016-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"天子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"同段賜胙的天子稱與前句相應，身份仍未定。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m016-0062","start":62,"end":65,"surface":"齊桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"9w2_c77_53m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m016-0074","start":74,"end":77,"surface":"楚成王","kind":"person","person_id":"osu_yvw_bwr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m016-0080","start":80,"end":82,"surface":"屈完","kind":"person","person_id":"xqc_j54_rtn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m016-0088","start":88,"end":90,"surface":"桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"9w2_c77_53m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m016-0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"9w2_c77_53m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m016-0115","start":115,"end":117,"surface":"成王","kind":"person","person_id":"osu_yvw_bwr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m016-0123","star